Spec: Iteration File Context

Purpose:
  Keep programming-iteration context broad across canonical project source while excluding generated command materializations and caches that duplicate canonical inputs.

Owns:
  ./files.include

Must:
  Canonical bridge, specification, test, workflow, and development files remain available when their file types are included.
  Generated Spec Kit command registrations are excluded when their canonical source is available elsewhere.
  Exclusions may remain prophylactic when generated state is absent.

Done when:
  Implementing agents receive broad useful repository context without duplicate generated command bodies.
